    "basic_qualifications": "- 3+ years of data engineering experience<br/>- Bachelor's degree<br/>- Experience operating highly available, distributed systems of data extraction, ingestion, and processing of large data sets, or experience in software development<br/>- Experience in one or more scripting languages (e.g., Python, Ruby, Perl)",
    "business_category": "north-america-stores",
